        - !<reference> 244a4d6c-f535-47ba-afbb-ccd3ceeecdb3
      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Hover the round button: the green box switches on while you hover and off when you leave. The ghost outline marks its place."
        - Pinch the button to toggle the green box on and off. The ghost outline shows where it sits.
        - "Hover the button: the pink box scales up on hover enter and back down on hover exit."
        - "Pinch the button: the blue box rotates and rises over a second, and toggles back on the next pinch."
        - "Pinch the button to play the elephant's Jump animation clip."
        - "Pinch the button to step through the children of Iteration Parent: one card is shown at a time, then it wraps around."
        - "Pinch the button: the box's redValue shader property animates to 1, then greenValue follows after a one second delay."
        - "Pinch the button: the image and the mesh fade to new base colors while the Text fades out."
        - "Pinch the button to call changeText on the script above it: the label changes from Meow to Woof."
        - "Pinch the button to toggle the elephant's Key 1 blendshape between 0 and 1 with an elastic ease."
        - Pinch the button to play the audio clip attached to the image above it.
        - "Pinch the button to play the video: the thumbnail hides while it plays and comes back when it ends."
      steps: !<reference.SceneObject[]>
        []
      stepInfo: !<string[]>
        []
      startIndex: !<float> 0.000000
      previousLabel: Previous
      nextLabel: Next
      examplesPushBack: !<float> 20.000000
      anchorExamples: true
      startMinimized: false
      extraPanelDrop: !<float> 0.000000
